==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
This stage is relatively easy, as you can kill the starting peons with high damage attacker to save enough money for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and
destroy the base before Le'Solar arrives. If you do not do this in time, you can still deploy Awakened Bahamut with meatshields to protect him from the upcoming LeMurrs, as Bahamut can handle 1 hit at level 30, allowing you to kill Le'Solar and leave the LeMurrs vulnerable.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
This version of this stage of very similar to the first chapter, as the only added enemy is UltraBaaBaa, which can be easily dealt with using [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breakers]] such as [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kendo Cat/Kitty of Liberty]], allowing you to use a similar strategy to the first chapter alternative.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This version of the stage is ironically easy, as the Gardeneel Bros. allow you to destroy the base even quicker than before. Just save money for Awakened Bahamut Cat and allow him to get warped, which moves him forwards to destroy the base. You can also allow a Kitty of Liberty to be warped and help deal with the UltraBaaBaas in case you don't destroy the base on time.

