==Trivia==
*Soba is a Japanese food, consisting of thin noodles, often served in hot broth as a noodle soup.
*Soba IV's Japanese name and [[Treasure]], Yakisopan and a Hero respectively, reference [[wikipedia:UFO Kamen Yakisoban|UFO Kamen Yakisoban]], a mascot for [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event|Nissin U.F.O.]] ''yakisoba'' noodles. The enemy base even has his signature colors: red and yellow.

